# A mirror of the whole solid so far (an extension): the extrusion of
# path_extrude mirrored in a face, then its screen's "the whole solid so
# far" box checked, and Check Solid; the box cleared again.
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
move 290 265
down L 290 265
up L 290 265
menu Features|Mirror
twmove 60 165
twdown L 60 165
twup L 60 165
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
twmove 60 165
twdown L 60 165
twup L 60 165
tw
